.SH NAME
scrollinit, scrolldraw, scrollmouse, scrollwid, scrollgap, tagopen, tagclose, tagctl, tagwrite, tagmread, tagreadevent, tagwriteevent, tagpipe \- helpers for acme-like graphical programs
