.SH BUGS
The tag doesn't yet have acme's expansion of
.B <file>
to an included file's name or its matching of HTML tags on a double click.
.PP
rio won't take a window as large as its screen, so button 3 leaves out the bottom row.
.PP
The screen the square keeps the window in is the one
.B /dev/draw/winname
names; for a rio running in another rio's window, which isn't that, the square's
rectangles are wrong.
